#. module: woow_ai_task_paas
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/woow_ai_task_paas/models/ir_module.py:0
msgid ""
"\"Project AI - PaaS\" cannot be uninstalled alone: uninstall \"Project AI\" "
"(woow_ai_task), which removes it too. Removing it alone would bring the old "
"task AI back."
msgstr "「專案 AI - PaaS」不能單獨解除安裝：請解除安裝「專案 AI」（woow_ai_task），它會一起移除。單獨移除會讓舊版任務 AI 回來。"

#. module: woow_ai_task_paas
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/woow_ai_task_paas/static/src/paas/task_chat/WoowProjectAiPaasTaskChat.xml:0
msgid ""
"Ask our AI assistant about this task, at any time. Your messages and files "
"are also visible to our team and to the other people who can see this task."
msgstr "隨時向我們的 AI 助理詢問這張任務。我們的同事和其他看得到這張任務的人，也看得到您的訊息和檔案。"

