#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/woow_ai_task_paas/static/src/paas/task_chat/WoowProjectAiPaasTaskChat.xml:0
msgid ""
"The customers of this task read this chat. A message of yours goes to them "
"and pauses the AI for a while; the AI does not answer colleagues here."
msgstr "這張任務的客戶看得到這個對話。您的訊息會傳給客戶，AI 也會暫停一段時間；AI 在這裡不回覆同事。"

#. module: woow_ai_task_paas
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/woow_ai_task_paas/models/legacy.py:0
msgid ""
"The old task AI is turned off. Customers: please use the \"Customer AI "
"Chat\" on the task page; colleagues: the \"Internal AI Chat\" on the task "
"form in the backend."
msgstr "舊版任務 AI 已停用。客戶請在任務頁使用「客戶 AI 對話」；同事請在後台任務表單使用「內部 AI 對話」。"

#. module: woow_ai_task_paas
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/woow_ai_task_paas/models/project_project.py:0
msgid ""
"The old task AI is turned off: the Agent Runtime cannot be turned on for a "
"project."
msgstr "舊版任務 AI 已停用，不能替專案開啟 Agent Runtime。"

